{"title": "Life Stealing Critical", "pageid": 28102, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Life_Stealing_Critical", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Life Stealing Critical</b> is a passive feature that deals extra damage on a critical hit and also gives you temporary hp.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>On a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a>, the target takes an extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage as long as it isn't a construct or an undead. You also gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"10 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Can only have temporary hit points from one source.</span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_.2810.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_(10)\"> Condition: Temporary Hit Points (10) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(10)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (10) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporary Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(10)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (10) (Condition)\">Temporary Hit Points</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Kept from death's door by a brief magical boost. Gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"10 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_Life_Stealing\" title=\"Sword of Life Stealing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_Life_Stealing\" title=\"Sword of Life Stealing\">Sword of Life Stealing</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the ambiguity of the description, only a critical hit from the weapon with Life Sealing Critical triggers its effect; it does not affect other equipped weapons.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The temporary hit points only have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1, and as such are overridden by any other source of temporary hit points that have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1 or higher, even if the new source is of a lesser value.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205006\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1721/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19454